w over a 30-year  period his irradiated genes allowed him  to grow to a height of almost 60 meters  or 200 feet even though this version  died the same few days after making  landfall in New York he would still be  around 30 years given the immaturity  period  number six gmk Godzilla the Godzilla in  gmk is a malignant monster formed from  the Restless Souls of people died as a  result of the Japanese military's acts  during World War II which have  congregated inside Godzilla's body and  who arrived in modern day Japan to seek  vengeance upon the nation so to say this  Godzilla that is reform would be as old  as his demise to form which would put it  around 47 years of age  number five heisei Godzilla it is  theorized that in the heisei era that  Godzilla and his ilk are descendants of  a dinosaur species gold godzillasaurus  which survived the demise of the  dinosaurs at the end of the Cretaceous  Period the godzillasaurus that would  later become Godzilla lived on Lagos  Island prior to World War II and was  altered by radioactive fallout so by the  end of the battle against destoroya this  Godzilla would have been around 80 to 90  years old  number four Godzilla singular Point  although little is known about the  nature of this Godzilla and where he  came from it is presumed that Godzilla  has been around for several centuries  because he appears in many Legends and  myths implying that he has interacted  with Humanity previously at various  stages of his life prior to his exposure  to the archetypal element that  transformed him into a bipedal dinosaur  in Kaiju so he is definitely between 500  to 1000 years of age  number three Godzilla Earth Godzilla  Earth is thought to be a plant-based  mutant that consume a tremendous amount  of metal elements throughout its  development and became a moving organism  that is indestructible slowly growing  over time this Godzilla like those and  the most of us and the shin continuities  has a new redesigned origin and he is  believed to be the end product of  natural selection on Earth and has gone  on to live and Conquer The Globe for 20  000 years from the 21st century till the  events of the planet eater in the future  number two show a Godzilla it is  proposed in the original Godzilla that  he was an ancient transitional reptile  connected to both land and sea reptiles  that slept deep underground for millions  of years until being disturbed by an  American hydrogen bomb test the second  Godzilla is also a member of the same  species and like his predecessor he was  presumably awoken by an American  hydrogen bomb test this puts them both  in the range of 65 to 100 million years  of age  and number one the Monster vs Godzilla  in the monsterverse comics Godzilla  Awakening the prequel to Godzilla the  movie The G-Man is explained to be an  ancient life form from the Permian  period which deviates from the  previously accepted origin tale of him  being deformed by the hydrogen bomb this  origin story would definitely put the  monster verse version as the oldest  Godzilla a super species being more than  252 million years of age and living  through many ages of the earth and also  coexisting with other super species  called Titans  so I hope you have enjoyed watching this  video do hit that like button for  support and subscribe but most of all  smash that Bell icon for regular updates  on new videos right here on this channel  till the next one take care fam

